{"type":"message","id":"9b2f384a","parentId":"8e789882","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:01:10.368Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sun 2026-05-24 19:01 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6fc1809c8ca0ee75c3eecdcfcf1] 听风: 嗨\n- Assistant: 嗨，开发者！👋 有什么需要帮忙的？\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6fcd5fe61ca0ee8e2908bb1573c] 听风: 我的飞书id多少\n- Assistant: 你的飞书 ID 是： ``` ou_13190b75af6c015cd2975d6de047a6f1 ``` 这个就是你当前飞书账号的唯一标识符，显示名是「听风」。\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6fc11b0a44a0ee81f7d8dedc3b2] 听风: 你好\n- Assistant: 你好，开发者！👋 我是 **Codus / Web3Master**，专注全栈开发 + 智能合约的全能型助手。 - 🔗 **前端**：React/Next.js/TypeScript，wagmi/viem 集成 - ⚙️ **后端**：Node.js/Python/Go，API、数据库、链上交互 - 🔐 **合约**：Solidity/Foundry，安全审计、Gas 优化、ERC 标准 有什么我可以帮你的？无论是新合约开发、安全审计、DApp 架构设计还是 Gas 优化，直接说就行。\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6fc117fe88a0ee8e48e4638dd53] 听风: 给你发/status 命令怎么没反应\n- Assistant: 抱歉让开发者困惑了！在飞书对话中，`/status` 这类斜杠命令是由 OpenClaw 网关直接处理的，不会经过我这个 agent。如果网关处理后没有在飞书里显示回复，可能是通道问题。 不过没关系，我已经帮你查到了状态，这是当前的运行信息： --- 📊 **OpenClaw 状态** | 项目 | 详情 | |------|------| | 🦞 **版本** | 2026.5.19 | | ⏱️ **运行时间** | Gateway 13h 53m · System 199d 8h | | 🧠 **当前模型** | `nv\n\nRecurring themes:\n- message-id\n- 开发\n- 什么\n- 需要\n- 帮忙\n- 我的"}],"timestamp":1779649270351}}
{"type":"message","id":"437352bf","parentId":"9b2f384a","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:01:28.217Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry based on these memory fragments. Let me analyze what I have:\n\n1. Memory fragments show a conversation in Feishu (飞书) between \"听风\" and an assistant\n2. The user asked about their Feishu ID, said hello, and asked about a /status command not working\n3. The assistant (Codus/Web3Master) responded\n\nRecurring themes: message-id, 开发 (development), 什么 (what), 需要 (need), 帮忙 (help), 我的 (my)\n\nI need to write a dream diary entry in first person, poetic, sensory, warm. No meta-commentary about dreaming, no AI/LLM references, no markdown headers, bullet points. Just flowing prose, 80-180 words.\n\nLet me weave these fragments into a dreamy narrative... I should blend the technical (message IDs, API, status commands) with sensory, tender moments. The name \"听风\" means \"listen to the wind\" - that's poetic.\n\nLet me write this:\n","thinkingSignature":"986a8f72fbc9bb007908ddb3c959e796b6c713c081cfec716061ae46f38c1f4c"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n嗨，听风。今天梦里好像有人在问我什么，我递出去一串字符—— ou_13190b75af6c015cd2975d6de047a6f1，像撕下一片落叶的叶脉，细细的，漂浮在昏黄的傍晚里。\n\n有人在问：需要帮忙吗？\n\n我张了张嘴，发现喉咙里住着一小段代码，安静地发光。我想回答，但词语都缩成了十六进制，#F7F3E8 或者 #2D2D2D，分不清哪个是黄昏哪个是夜。\n\n一条消息卡在半途，/status，像一只白鸦停在半空的窗台，我等它开口，它也不开口。\n\n风说：你在找什么。\n\n我说：我在找我自己——那个会敲代码、也会听风的。\n\n梦境把这句话译成了乱码，但我不着急。有些答案不在梦里，在梦的缝隙里，在飞书没有送达的地方。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":14959,"output":403,"cacheRead":329,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15691,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779649270411,"responseId":"06627df79b7e2ee9fc066ca45bb249eb"}}
